erials into usable resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Elevators</strong>: Transport resources betweens layers!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.poster.avif?t=1751388412\" width=600 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.webm?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7f9fb63c1559ef615d2c3857dd418d22.mp4?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progress Through Layers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new challenges at each layer. Complete levels by meeting specific resource requirements to unlock the next layer. Develop strategies and optimize your factory layout to solve increasingly complex puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Elevate Your Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the use of the Elevator, your main block for vertically moving resources and transporting objects between different layers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.poster.avif?t=1751388412\" width=600 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.webm?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/extras/7986cc35d7fd59f83a3934782c747670.mp4?t=1751388412\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression and Unlockables</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance in the game by meeting resource requirements and unlocking new layers. Discover new challenges at each stage as you progress through Ascend Factory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Future Under Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing, with <strong>new content updates</strong> and <strong>bug fixes</strong> on the way. Your feedback is crucial in shaping the ultimate <strong>Ascend Factory</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to build the ultimate automated tower?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Matlyce Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2736930/header.jpg?t=1751388412","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736930/817603/c43256394dbbbca61c032eaf957fcf6e443d980f/1750895613/dash_av1.mpd?t=1737669968","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736930/817603/c43256394dbbbca61c032eaf957fcf6e443d980f/1750895613/dash_h264.mpd?t=1737669968","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736930/817603/c43256394dbbbca61c032eaf957fcf6e443d980f/1750895613/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1737669968","id":257091696,"name":"Ascend Factory - Trailer 2 - 2025","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257091696/a56e3b43307155cd705e958910724d6ed6df3c82/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1737669968"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2736930/690095/2fc6f9abfea1cfece4e